urname><given-names>KE</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahamed</surname><given-names>MZ</given-names></name><name><surname>Praveen</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Atypical relapsing course of Kawasaki Disease with Hemorrhagic Serous Effusions with Hepatic Dysfunction</article-title><source>Indian Pediatr</source><year>2007</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>785</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17998582</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tiao</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>LT</given-names></name><name><surname>Liang</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><name><surname>Ko</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Atypical Kawasaki disease presenting as intestinal pseudo-obstruction</article-title><source>J Formos Med Assoc</source><year>2006</year><volume>105</volume><fpage>252</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16520844</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yamazaki-Nakashimada</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramirez-Vargas</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>De Rubens-Figueroa</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Chronic granulomatous disease associated with atypical Kawasaki disease</article-title><source>Pediatr Cardiol</source><year>2008</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>169</fpage><lpage>71</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17676373</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Saint-Faust</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><s